sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to request the Charging Station to start a transaction.

    CSMS->>CS: RequestStartTransactionRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken><br>idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>

    CS-->>CSMS: RequestStartTransactionResponse (status = Accepted, transactionId omitted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = RemoteStart, transactionInfo.remoteStartId = <By Test System generated remoteStartID>, eventType = Started)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted<br>(State is Authorized and _EVConnected = false)
